      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks good, a couple of minor things inline.\n\n\nOverall though: have you tested with other compression types? busybox tar requires different options for gzip (`-x`) vs bz2 (\u0027-j`) vs xz (`-J`), but your detection logic only adds `-x` for any of those three.\n\nOn the other hand, GNU tar does the autodetection itself, so doesn\u0027t need any `-x` option, we should check whether just using that is simpler....",
      "revId": "a41b62f57299a98f97dea8c3b345b8ba2033db92",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
