      "writtenOn": "2026-05-23T05:16:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right. Patchset #4 only supported gzip, so in patchset #5 I added support for all supported compression formats except lzma, and tested them all.\n\nAs you mentioned, the current BusyBox tar v1.37 in the OpenBMC build was compiled with CONFIG_FEATURE_TAR_AUTODETECT enabled, so compression formats are automatically detected and handled. However, the current extraction logic in this code uses a pipe, which prevents the autodetection from working.\n\nI added a more detailed explanation about the reason in the commit message, so please take a look.",
      "parentUuid": "ed87bfc2_d7faf2cb",
      "revId": "a41b62f57299a98f97dea8c3b345b8ba2033db92",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
