      "message": "You could also make these three checks a little less hard-coded with an array of magic bytes that you check for; that would save the multiple-array-index checks, and make it easier to support new formats in future.\n\n\nThe downside is the complexity of the array-of-arrays-of-chars, but there can be neat ways to define that.\n\n(however, this may become preferable if we add support for `-j` / `-J` too)",
